{"data":{"allProjectsJson":{"sections":[{"button":{"label":"View more on my GitHub","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/","visible":true},"projects":[{"category":"AI Chatbots","description":"A Chatbot combining the robustness of Next.js, the intelligence of OpenAI, and the aesthetics of Tailwind CSS, all deployed via Vercel. Designed to deliver a conversational experience that's smooth, natural, and engaging, it utilizes OpenAI's language models to understand context and generate replies, providing users with a taste of the future of human-computer interaction.","image":{"alt":"Next Chatbot Interface","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/0ce21/chatbot.png","srcSet":"/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/4205b/chatbot.png 82w,\n/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/0d1dc/chatbot.png 164w,\n/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/0ce21/chatbot.png 327w","sizes":"(min-width: 327px) 327px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/c88f5/chatbot.webp 82w,\n/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/af9e8/chatbot.webp 164w,\n/static/17c78f767e07ef0c563230f8011d894b/da0b9/chatbot.webp 327w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 327px) 327px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":856.2691131498472}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/next-chat-bot"}],"tags":["Next.js","OpenAI","Vercel","Tailwind CSS","AI","Natural Language Processing","Server-Side Rendering","Responsive Design","Chatbot"],"title":"NextAI Chatbot","visible":true},{"category":"Chrome Extensions","description":"Meowify is a whimsical Chrome extension that transforms the text of any webpage into 'meow,' mimicking the language of cats. This project was designed to provide a humorous and engaging way to interact with web content, instantly altering text upon a single click. Key features include toggling between original text and 'meowified' text, ensuring a reversible, fun browsing experience. The extension employs minimal permissions to enhance user security and was developed using modern web technologies, including HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.","image":{"alt":"Meowify Chrome Extension","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/ee46d/meowify.png","srcSet":"/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/c770b/meowify.png 100w,\n/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/40cd2/meowify.png 200w,\n/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/ee46d/meowify.png 400w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/6d7e6/meowify.webp 100w,\n/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/634c8/meowify.webp 200w,\n/static/d92cb52772d5b369b73bf8956686da66/cd94f/meowify.webp 400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":249}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/meowify"},{"type":"external","url":"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/meowify/pafcljcamickajmfhgadcfflnennonop"}],"tags":["JavaScript","Chrome Extension","User Interface","Web Development","ActiveTab Permission","Scripting","Web Content Manipulation","Privacy Focused"],"title":"Meowify - Chrome Extension","visible":true},{"category":"Interactive Web Experiences","description":"This project was an in-depth journey into creating highly interactive and visually appealing web experiences using GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform) for animations and Three.js for 3D modeling. Key features: Implementing complex animations with GSAP, integrating 3D models seamlessly into web pages, setting up Sentry for error logging and mastering the art of crafting engaging UI sections such as products, hero sections, highlights, video carousels, and more!","image":{"alt":"Interactive Web Experience with GSAP and 3D Modeling","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/1d50e/3d-showcase.png","srcSet":"/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/99cd4/3d-showcase.png 100w,\n/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/ec41a/3d-showcase.png 200w,\n/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/1d50e/3d-showcase.png 400w,\n/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/c82a6/3d-showcase.png 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/b8fa4/3d-showcase.webp 100w,\n/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/b3a0c/3d-showcase.webp 200w,\n/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/dc285/3d-showcase.webp 400w,\n/static/5a6c1da3e2fdb9e79f12510a358be646/c4da0/3d-showcase.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":296}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"external","url":"https://nm-3d-showcase.netlify.app/"}],"tags":["GSAP","Three.js","Web Animation","3D Modeling","Interactive Design","Project Deployment","UI/UX Design","Web Development","Video Carousel","Performance Optimization","Sentry Performance Monitoring"],"title":"Interactive Product page with GSAP and Three.js","visible":true},{"category":"Web Applications","description":"At Ajar, a pioneering PropTech firm in the Middle East, I took the helm of frontend development to institute major platform overhauls and innovatively integrate new features. I completely reconstructed the landing pages using Angular and Bootstrap, which directly translated into a 30% uptick in user engagement. I optimized the login and sign-up processes, added robust features like expense management and report downloading, and revamped the leases management system. Furthermore, I championed the migration from Firebase APIs to REST APIs, improving backend data handling and overall platform responsiveness. As a testament to my adaptability, I seamlessly transitioned from React to Angular within a tight two-month window. In collaboration with marketing initiatives, I drove the implementation of Facebook and Snapchat tracking pixels, culminating in a notable 20% increase in high-value clients. By incorporating automated test cases using Playwright with GitHub workflows, I advanced the deployment process, ensuring faster release cycles, a heightened code quality, and a 35% reduction in bug resolution time. Throughout, I maintained the brand's graphic consistency and high-quality standards, further elevating the platform's user experience.","image":{"alt":"Ajar","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/5f2c3/ajar.png","srcSet":"/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/90cd3/ajar.png 100w,\n/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/614dc/ajar.png 200w,\n/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/5f2c3/ajar.png 400w,\n/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/8cb4c/ajar.png 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/e64f1/ajar.webp 100w,\n/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/8b00d/ajar.webp 200w,\n/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/9c0a1/ajar.webp 400w,\n/static/7b6f4b30c56c7ee3e44148f42b2bb61c/88f3e/ajar.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":400}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"external","url":"https://joinajar.com/landlord"}],"tags":["Angular","Tailwind","Bootstrap","i18n","Transifex","Playwright","GitHub Workflows","REST APIs","Expense Tracking","Localization","Multilingual Deployment","Web Applications","Enterprise Level Apps","User Engagement","Performance Optimization","Firebase Migration","Marketing Integration","Brand Consistency","Sentry Error Handling","Pagination and Filtering","Mobile Responsiveness"],"title":"Ajar PropTech Platform Overhaul and Enhancement","visible":true},{"category":"Web Applications","description":"Designed a comprehensive tenant dashboard prototype to assist newcomers in the MENA property market. The dashboard provides an overview of rent payments, maintenance requests, and essential property documentation. Tenants also gain insights into regional news and can efficiently manage work order requests, receipt histories, and critical document storage. Integrated Auth0 for secure login and Ant Design for a scalable UI. The responsive design ensures a seamless experience across devices.","image":{"alt":"Tenant Dashboard Prototype","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/ac97f/tenant-proto.png","srcSet":"/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/fb09a/tenant-proto.png 100w,\n/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/6e68f/tenant-proto.png 200w,\n/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/ac97f/tenant-proto.png 400w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/fbf53/tenant-proto.webp 100w,\n/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/e6d96/tenant-proto.webp 200w,\n/static/edb15e27fb917be9a3764827a297f9fa/7ad9f/tenant-proto.webp 400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":451}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/tenant-proto"},{"type":"external","url":"https://nm-tenant-prototype.netlify.app"}],"tags":["React","Ant Design","React Router","Auth0","Moment.js","Particle JS","Enterprise Level Apps","Web Applications"],"title":"Tenant Dashboard Solution","visible":true},{"category":"Web Applications","description":"Developed a replica of the GitHub trending page to understand the intricacies of popular repositories' display. Leveraged React for UI components, Tailwind for styling, and efficiently fetched data with react query and axios.","image":{"alt":"GitHub Trending Clone","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/b06f5/gh-trending-clone.png","srcSet":"/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/995d9/gh-trending-clone.png 100w,\n/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/ff2f1/gh-trending-clone.png 200w,\n/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/b06f5/gh-trending-clone.png 400w,\n/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/0695f/gh-trending-clone.png 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/8c4c0/gh-trending-clone.webp 100w,\n/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/d424a/gh-trending-clone.webp 200w,\n/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/95391/gh-trending-clone.webp 400w,\n/static/a9bc7cc5914fecd940edaf8b577f635f/e6358/gh-trending-clone.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":259}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/github-trending-clone"}],"tags":["React","react select","react router","axios","react query","Tailwind","API Integration","Web Applications"],"title":"GitHub Trending Page Replica","visible":true},{"category":"Web Applications","description":"Built an interactive e-commerce SPA using Commerce.js and React. Seamlessly integrated Stripe for payments and used React Hook Forms for efficient customer data management. Styled using Material UI.","image":{"alt":"Jungle CommerceJS","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/49397/jungle-commerce-js.jpg","srcSet":"/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/f2ddf/jungle-commerce-js.jpg 96w,\n/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/24f4c/jungle-commerce-js.jpg 191w,\n/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/49397/jungle-commerce-js.jpg 382w","sizes":"(min-width: 382px) 382px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/f9632/jungle-commerce-js.webp 96w,\n/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/e34ef/jungle-commerce-js.webp 191w,\n/static/21a8bf003241d049e69acfeb6980efac/c102f/jungle-commerce-js.webp 382w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 382px) 382px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":519.3717277486911}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/jungle-commerce-js"},{"type":"external","url":"https://junglecommercejs.netlify.app/"}],"tags":["React","CommerceJS","React Hook Forms","Material UI","React Router","Stripe Integration","E-commerce"],"title":"Jungle E-commerce Webshop","visible":true},{"category":"Web Applications","description":"Crafted a user-friendly expense tracker in React. Users can seamlessly log expenses, filter by year, and visualize data through an intuitive bar chart. Achieved efficient initial rendering with CRA.","image":{"alt":"Expense Tracker","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/663e5/expense-tracker.png","srcSet":"/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/14e88/expense-tracker.png 100w,\n/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/363de/expense-tracker.png 200w,\n/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/663e5/expense-tracker.png 400w,\n/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/66a2a/expense-tracker.png 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/bfea6/expense-tracker.webp 100w,\n/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/c2ee9/expense-tracker.webp 200w,\n/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/14d7b/expense-tracker.webp 400w,\n/static/a7d3aff59c701a7b5c1c2684a6027b8a/43e7c/expense-tracker.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":519}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/react-expense-tracker"},{"type":"external","url":"https://nm-expense-tracker.netlify.app/"}],"tags":["React","CRA","Data Visualization","Web Applications"],"title":"Intuitive Expense Tracker","visible":true},{"category":"Web Applications","description":"Designed an elegant recipe viewer with Gatsby and Contentful. Users can effortlessly explore recipes through tags or a dedicated list. Each recipe page offers detailed instructions, serving sizes, and necessary cooking appliances.","image":{"alt":"Gatsby Recipe App","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/fc211/gatsby-recipe.jpg","srcSet":"/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/03424/gatsby-recipe.jpg 100w,\n/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/6b634/gatsby-recipe.jpg 200w,\n/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/fc211/gatsby-recipe.jpg 400w,\n/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/601bd/gatsby-recipe.jpg 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/f35b7/gatsby-recipe.webp 100w,\n/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/b1715/gatsby-recipe.webp 200w,\n/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/dcbf7/gatsby-recipe.webp 400w,\n/static/866d119fb99c6f43ba415b617ce22de1/6dd45/gatsby-recipe.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":213}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/gatsby-recipes-app"},{"type":"external","url":"https://nm-gatsby-recipes.netlify.app/"}],"tags":["Gatsby","GraphQL","Contentful","SEO","Image Optimization","Web Applications"],"title":"Gourmet Recipe Viewer","visible":true},{"category":"Entertainment Apps","description":"Crafted a fun SPA with Vite, giving fans of the show a chance to discover random characters and their backstories. Developed using Typescript and React and brought to life with Tailwind styling.","image":{"alt":"Rick and Morty Randomizer App","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/b90a8/r-m-r.png","srcSet":"/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/dd2cc/r-m-r.png 100w,\n/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/ae3c1/r-m-r.png 200w,\n/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/b90a8/r-m-r.png 400w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/12e58/r-m-r.webp 100w,\n/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/03e9c/r-m-r.webp 200w,\n/static/bfcfae6731b88c3a7f547eff70f92e4a/ef1d0/r-m-r.webp 400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":403}}},"objectFit":null},"links":[{"type":"github","url":"https://github.com/NigelMarshal/rick-and-morty-randomizer"},{"type":"external","url":"https://nm-rick-and-morty-randomizer.netlify.app/"}],"tags":["React","Vite","Typescript","Entertainment"],"title":"Rick and Morty Character Showcase","visible":true},{"category":"E-commerce","description":"Developed a dynamic food ordering SPA. Showcased dishes from an API based on inventory and discounts. Enhanced user experience by preserving cart data using local storage. Styled with React and Tailwind.","image":{"alt":"Food Ordering App","linkTo":null,"src":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;ba